                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8627b397-356f-464d-aaab-83d94095a0ab",
                                                "sense_id": "4284396e-dad2-32d2-b6ba-4f29e69c42b2",
                                                "text": "“Like vanilla, but better,” she explains. “It’s fragrant and herbal, like you’re taking a big breath of the forest. I can’t believe white people haven’t learned about pandan yet.”"
